- Breaking change: "Delete report by ID" moved to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:id` and "Delete report by name" moved to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/name/:name`. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/id/:id` still works but is deprecated. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:name` no longer deletes by name and returns 410 with a link to the Fleet 5 migration guide. For a report whose name is only digits (for example `42`), an older `fleetctl delete` or script now deletes the report with that ID instead. After you upgrade to Fleet 5, upgrade `fleetctl` and switch scripts to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/name/:name`. API-only users' existing delete-report permissions are carried over to the new URLs.
